# Direct dependencies of the hf-export step. The hashed, platform-pinned lock is
# requirements.lock, recompiled with `make lock`; the Dockerfile installs only that.
#
# Pinned to what the distillation CPU image (steps/distill/images/cpu/uv.lock) ran this
# step with, so moving it to its own image changes no behaviour. No torch: export
# only copies files, and verify loads config and tokenizer, never the weights.
